repository-code: "https://github.com/Revanth597/rafs-vi"

abstract: >
  RAFS-VI is an embedded AI wearable assistive system for visually
  impaired users. The system performs real-time object detection,
  monocular distance estimation, and offline auditory feedback using
  a Sipeed MaixCam running a YOLOv11 Nano object detection model.

keywords:
  - assistive technology
  - embedded AI
  - computer vision
  - wearable computing
  - monocular vision
  - object detection
  - distance estimation
  - YOLOv11
  - MaixCam
  - edge AI
  - visual impairment

